# 多键 sort（优先级 + 方向）与单键 sort 稳定 tie-break（file.path ASC 兜底）
views:
  - type: table
    name: multi
    filters: 'type == "project"'
    order:
      - file.name
      - priority
    sort:
      - property: priority
        direction: DESC
      - property: file.name
        direction: ASC
  - type: table
    name: stable
    filters: 'type == "project"'
    order:
      - file.path
      - priority
    sort:
      - property: priority
        direction: ASC
